{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763600/extras/Steam_separator.png?t=1749568514\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763600/extras/Puzzle.gif?t=1749568514\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make your way through a\u00a0dense forest, solving puzzles based on loading parts of the game. Special loading torches and you \u2014 the player character \u2014 help keep the world stable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As of now, only 4 puzzles are available in this demo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763600/extras/Steam_blank_separator.png?t=1749568514\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763600/extras/Steam_separator2.png?t=1749568514\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763600/extras/Character-246.png?t=1749568514\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet the <strong>Northuldra</strong> inhabitants. When the world suddenly shuts down, having been dropped from the device's memory, they cannot move. Therefore, they will need your help.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As of now, only 4 characters are available to interact with in this demo.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763600/extras/Steam_blank_separator.png?t=1749568514\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763600/extras/Steam_separator3.png?t=1749568514\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The world is non-linear: each solved puzzle opens up new parts of the game to explore. Navigate through the world's unloaded tiles.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3763600?t=1749568514","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3763600?t=1749568514","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763600/02d601237261b92dacebcfbd85314e195e79b229/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749568514","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763600/02d601237261b92dacebcfbd85314e195e79b229/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749568514","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763600/extras/Steam_separator.png?t=1749568514\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763600/extras/Puzzle.gif?t=1749568514\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make your way through a\u00a0dense forest, solving puzzles based on loading parts of the game. Special loading torches and you \u2014 the player character \u2014 help keep the world stable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As of now, only 4 puzzles are available in this demo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763600/extras/Steam_blank_separator.png?t=1749568514\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763600/extras/Steam_separator2.png?t=1749568514\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763600/extras/Character-246.png?t=1749568514\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mee